    "title": "Who are the Benton County area high school alumni in action on Saturday, Dec. 20? - Benton Times",
    "text": "Dane Williams and Mike Ericson\nThese ex-Benton County area high school standouts will participate in competitions on Saturday, Dec. 20.\nDane Williams Harding Bison Freshman 6′1″ 210 Rogers High School Hometown: Rogers Next Game: vs. Ferris State Bulldogs, Saturday, Dec. 20, 3 p.m.\nEli Brooks Harding Bison Wide receiver Freshman 6′2″ 210 Bentonville High School Hometown: Bentonville Next Game: vs. Ferris State Bulldogs, Saturday, Dec. 20, 3 p.m.\nMabry Verser Harding Bison Freshman 6′3″ 220 Rogers High School Hometown: Rogers Next Game: vs. Ferris State Bulldogs, Saturday, Dec. 20, 3 p.m.\nMike Ericson Harding Bison Senior 6′3″ 290 Pea Ridge High School Hometown: Pea Ridge Next Game: vs. Ferris State Bulldogs, Saturday, Dec. 20, 3 p.m.",
